            <ArticleTitle>[A comparative evaluation of the anti-ischemic action of verapamil in different models of myocardial ischemia].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>21-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The effectiveness of the anti-ischemic effect of verapamil was studied on models of coronary spasm (the test with dihydroergotamine) and microthrombosis of the coronary arteries (the test with ADP). The results of the performed studies showed that verapamil exerts the anti-ischemic effect at administration of dihydroergotamine and ADP. The most pronounced effect of verapamil was demonstrated on the model of myocardial ischemia due to coronary spasm.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
